--spec mtp --spec-k 2: the default of recipe qwen3_5_vl on cuda at tp=1 ([tuning.cuda] mtp_default_k; --spec off or INTARSIA_SPEC_DEFAULT=0 turns it off)
prefill chunk 256 (default)
mtp: drafter head 'mtp' loaded in 1.4 s (routed experts quantised to nvfp4)
--mtp-draft-vocab 65536 (recipe qwen3_5_vl, cuda; --mtp-draft-vocab 0 drafts with the full head)
verify attention rows: engaged (one row-table attention launch per layer)
quantisation scheme note: checkpoint declares MXFP4 activations 'dynamic' (MXFP4_W4A4); running 'none' (the recipe's default, chosen for accuracy (Qwen3.8-27B, full MMLU n=1425: W4A16 0.822 vs W4A4 0.802, docs/results/2026-10-27-act27-27b-w4a16-mmlu.md; costs prefill and decode speed); --mxfp4-act dynamic runs the declared scheme): a deviation from the declared scheme and from a reference that runs it
mxfp4 activations: none (recipe qwen3_5_vl [defaults] mxfp4_act)
--spec mtp on cuda: verify rows run the row-exact kernels (bitwise the single-row decode per row)
speculative decoding: Mtp, up to 2 drafts per verify pass; verify kernels: embedding=embedding_bf16 rmsnorm=rmsnorm_bf16 matmul_mxfp4=matmul_mxfp4_gemv_mr_rows gdn_conv=gdn_conv_bf16 gdn_delta_rule=gdn_delta_rule_bf16_split gated_rmsnorm=gated_rmsnorm_bf16 rmsnorm_add=rmsnorm_add_bf16 silu_glu=silu_glu_bf16 gate_split=gate_split_bf16 qk_norm=qk_norm_bf16 rope=rope_bf16 kv_append=kv_append_bf16 attn_decode=attn_decode_bf16_splitkv_rows sigmoid_mul=sigmoid_mul_bf16 matmul=matmul_bf16_gemv add=add_bf16 logits=logits_bf16_gemv argmax=argmax_f32 logits=logits_bf16_gemv_rows
sampled requests (temperature > 0): speculation Match (default; single sequence, one rank)
